      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "How a team uses UnityStack to take a project from idea to production and back. UnityStack itself can run locally; the project it manages is deployed to staging and production on AWS.\nEach box is a screen or a system step. Orange tag = a person decides. Grey = external tool. Dashed = after the MVP.",
      "originalText": "How a team uses UnityStack to take a project from idea to production and back. UnityStack itself can run locally; the project it manages is deployed to staging and production on AWS.\nEach box is a screen or a system step. Orange tag = a person decides. Grey = external tool. Dashed = after the MVP.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
