      "updated": 1764273600000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• Example: TODO-7 · Reminders (requirement) → TODO-52 story (OpenProject #1234) → PR #12 → checks ✓ → tests ✓ → v0.3.0 → staging → production → logs → bug TODO-61\n• Verified links come from keys in branches, commits, PRs, tags and tickets\n• Missing links are shown as gaps, never filled in by AI",
      "originalText": "• Example: TODO-7 · Reminders (requirement) → TODO-52 story (OpenProject #1234) → PR #12 → checks ✓ → tests ✓ → v0.3.0 → staging → production → logs → bug TODO-61\n• Verified links come from keys in branches, commits, PRs, tags and tickets\n• Missing links are shown as gaps, never filled in by AI",
